{"name": "Portfolio", "html": "<section class=\"mrspb-hero\" data-gsap=\"fade\" style=\"padding:120px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed 0%,#2563eb 100%);color:#fff;text-align:center;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\"><h1 data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#fff;\">My Portfolio</h1><p data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:.9;color:#fff;\">Showcase your work with a stunning, responsive portfolio layout.</p><a href=\"#\" data-gsap=\"zoom-in\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Get Started</a></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:50px;color:#0f172a;\">Selected Work</h2><div class=\"mrspb-masonry\" style=\"columns:3 250px;column-gap:16px;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"></div></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-cta\" data-gsap=\"fade\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#7c3aed);color:#fff;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:36px;margin-bottom:15px;\">Start your project</h2><p data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:18px;opacity:.9;margin-bottom:30px;\">Start building your next page today.</p><a href=\"#\" data-gsap=\"zoom-in\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;background:#fff;color:#2563eb;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Get Started</a></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:30px;color:#0f172a;\">Get in touch</h2><form class=\"mrspb-form\" data-form-id=\"contact\" style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Name</label><input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Email</label><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Message</label><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:12px 24px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\">Send Message</button></form></div></section>", "css": ""}